    Task 1 — Mini CRM
    Leadlarni qabul qilish, boshqarish va statusini o'zgartirish mumkin bo'lgan kichik CRM product yarating.
    Vazifa
    Sizga kichik kompaniya uchun lead management system yaratish vazifasi beriladi.

    System foydalanuvchiga leadlarni yaratish, ko'rish, tahrirlash va statusini boshqarish imkonini berishi kerak.

    Minimum requirements
    Lead yaratish: name, phone/email, source, note
    Lead list: pagination, search, status filter
    Lead status: New, Contacted, Qualified, Won, Lost
    Lead detail: barcha ma'lumotlarni ko'rish, edit qilish, statusni o'zgartirish
    Backend API: authentication, CRUD API, validation, pagination, filtering
    Database: relational database ishlatish tavsiya qilinadi
    Basic error handling
    Candidate'dan kutiladi
    Faqat UI yasash emas - backend architecture va data modelni ham tushunishingiz kerak
    AI tools ishlatish mumkin
    Lekin AI'dan foydalangan joylaringizni tushuntira olishingiz kerak
    Generated code'ni tushunishingiz kerak
    Architecture qarorlaringizni izohlay olishingiz kerak
    Bonus (majburiy emas)
    Activity / history
    Sorting
    Dashboard statistics
    Docker
    Tests
    API documentation
    Deliverable
    Working application
    Source code
    README va setup instructions
    Qisqa architecture explanation
    Public GitHub repository URL (majburiy)
    Deployed/demo URL (iloji bo'lsa)
    Asosiy e'tibor
    Backend architecture va data model
    API dizayni: CRUD, validation, pagination, filtering
    Authentication va error handling
    Git tarixi: bosqichma-bosqich ishlanganmi
    Documentation va tushuntirish sifati
    AI'dan



     foydalanish usuli va natijani tekshirish